build scripts and the design.

It does not cover the texts the application displays. The Thirukkural itself is
ancient and in the public domain. The three prose commentaries — by
மு. வரதராசனார், சாலமன் பாப்பையா and மு. கருணாநிதி — are modern works whose
rights belong to their authors and publishers; they are included here as
scholarly reference with attribution on every kural, and they are not licensed
for redistribution under the terms above. See CONTENT.md.

